"共同利益":"Common interest",
"各国在太空的活动应适当顾及其他国家的相应利益；可能造成有害干扰时，应先进行国际协商。":"States should pay due regard to the corresponding interests of other States in their space activities; where harmful interference is possible, international consultation should come first.",
"各国对本国在太空的活动负国际责任，不论由政府还是私人实体进行；私人活动须经国家批准并持续监督。":"States bear international responsibility for their national activities in space, whether carried out by governmental or private entities; private activities require authorization and continuing supervision by the State.",
