"安全区不产生排他权，只是协调手段；作业方须事先通报、减少扬尘，进入方须尊重通报，各自对自己的过错负责。":"A safety zone creates no exclusive right; it is only a coordination device. The working party must give prior notice and reduce dust; the entering party must respect the notice; each answers for its own fault.",
