"未登记且长期失联的物体构成碰撞威胁时，经查询登记、公告通知而无人回应，第三方可为避险移开并妥善保管，但不取得所有权。":"Where an unregistered, long-silent object poses a collision threat, and after registry searches and public notice draw no response, a third party may move it to avoid danger and keep it safely, but acquires no ownership.",
