"登记国的公开邀请构成同意；受邀方审慎作业并留痕的，不构成侵犯管辖权。":"A public invitation by the State of registry constitutes consent; where the invited party works prudently and keeps records, there is no infringement of jurisdiction.",
"私人公司在太空做事，国家要不要管、要不要负责":"Private companies in space: should the State supervise, should it answer",
