"《外空条约》把航天员称作“人类的使者”。这份协定把营救义务写细了：航天员遇险，各国应当营救并送回。":"The Outer Space Treaty calls astronauts \"envoys of mankind.\" This Agreement spells out the rescue duty: where astronauts are in distress, States should rescue and return them.",
