"一个重复出现的窄带信号，来自约 41 光年外。要不要回信、由谁回信、说什么——这一次，问题摆在了你面前。（游戏第六章）":"A repeating narrowband signal from about 41 light-years away. Whether to reply, who should reply, and what to say: this time the question is yours. (Chapter Six of the game)",
"一份不具法律约束力的原则声明，由一批国家陆续签署。它提出月面作业可以划“安全区”，并认为开采资源本身不等于据为己有。并非所有航天国家都认同这条路线。":"A non-binding declaration of principles, signed over time by a group of States. It proposes that lunar operations may mark \"safety zones,\" and holds that extracting resources is not itself appropriation. Not every spacefaring State accepts this route.",
"一家私营公司清除了一颗失联六年的他国卫星，被登记国告上仲裁庭。（游戏第三章）":"A private company removed another State's satellite that had been silent for six years, and was brought before the tribunal by the State of registry. (Chapter Three of the game)",
"一座从未登记的小行星采矿站失联漂移，被一家小型打捞合作社拖离航道。（游戏第四章）":"An unregistered asteroid mining station, drifting and silent, was towled off the shipping lane by a small salvage cooperative. (Chapter Four of the game)",
"一颗在役通信卫星和一颗报废的老卫星在西伯利亚上空相撞，产生上千块可追踪碎片。当时没有人提出索赔。本游戏第二章由此改编。":"An active communications satellite and a dead old one collided over Siberia, producing over a thousand trackable fragments. No claim was made at the time. Chapter Two of this game is adapted from it.",
"一颗重约 8 吨的地球观测卫星突然失去联系，至今仍在轨道上，成了最受关注的大型碎片之一。谁有权去清理它？本游戏第三章由此展开。":"An Earth-observation satellite of about 8 tons suddenly fell silent and remains in orbit, one of the most watched large debris objects. Who has the right to clean it up? Chapter Three of this game starts here.",
"东方红一号":"Dongfanghong-1",
"两家机构在同一片冰区作业，粉尘、剐蹭与“安全区”的效力一起摆上了仲裁庭。（游戏第五章）":"Two institutions working the same ice field: dust, scrapes, and the force of a \"safety zone\" all came before the tribunal together. (Chapter Five of the game)",
"两艘旅行者号探测器各带一张镀金唱片，录有 55 种语言的问候、自然声音和各地音乐，寄给可能捡到它的“谁”。":"The two Voyager probes each carry a gold-plated record with greetings in 55 languages, sounds of nature and music from around the world, addressed to whoever might pick it up.",
