"中国第一颗人造卫星升空，在轨道上播放《东方红》乐曲。":"China's first artificial satellite went up, playing the tune of \"The East Is Red\" in orbit.",
"人们开始在月球和小行星上干活。地图上第一次出现了“谁能用这块地”的问题。":"People began working on the Moon and asteroids. For the first time the map raised the question: \"who gets to use this ground?\"",
"人类探测器第一次在月球背面软着陆。":"A human probe soft-landed on the far side of the Moon for the first time.",
