"八个赤道国家联合声明：自己领土正上方的地球静止轨道属于本国主权。主张没有被国际接受，但它提出了一个真问题：稀缺的轨道资源，凭什么只给先到的国家？":"Eight equatorial States jointly declared that the geostationary orbit directly above their territory belonged to their sovereignty. The claim was not accepted internationally, but it raised a real question: why should a scarce orbital resource go only to whoever got there first?",
"冷战正紧的时候，美国阿波罗飞船和苏联联盟号在轨道上对接，两国航天员握了手。":"At the height of the Cold War, an American Apollo spacecraft and a Soviet Soyuz docked in orbit, and the astronauts shook hands.",
