"约翰·格伦绕地飞行前，点名要非裔数学家凯瑟琳·约翰逊手工复核计算机算出的轨道。她和同事们的贡献，几十年后才被广泛知道。":"Before his orbital flight, John Glenn asked for the African American mathematician Katherine Johnson to check the computer's trajectory by hand. Her and her colleagues' contributions became widely known only decades later.",
