"1967 年生效的太空“基本法”，全称很长，大家都简称它。核心几条：太空和天体不归任何国家所有；只能和平利用；国家要为本国在太空里的活动负责。":"The \"basic law\" of space, in force since 1967; the full title is long, so everyone shortens it. The core points: space and celestial bodies belong to no State; use is peaceful only; States answer for their national activities in space.",
"1989 年国际宇航科学院等机构通过的一份宣言：如果真的探测到地外文明信号，先核实、再公布；在国际协商之前，不要擅自回应。它没有法律约束力，但被广泛参考。":"A declaration adopted in 1989 by the International Academy of Astronautics and others: if a signal from an extraterrestrial civilization is truly detected, verify first, then announce; do not reply on your own before international consultation. It is not legally binding, but is widely consulted.",
"《关于各国探索和利用包括月球和其他天体在内外层空间活动的原则条约》，1967":"Treaty on Principles Governing the Activities of States in the Exploration and Use of Outer Space, including the Moon and Other Celestial Bodies, 1967",
"《关于探测到地外智慧后行动的原则宣言》，1989（2010 修订）":"Declaration of Principles concerning Activities following the Detection of Extraterrestrial Intelligence, 1989 (revised 2010)",
"《关于登记射入外层空间物体的公约》，1975":"Convention on Registration of Objects Launched into Outer Space, 1975",
"《外空条约》第九条；国际电联《无线电规则》":"Outer Space Treaty, Article IX; ITU Radio Regulations",
"《外空活动争端仲裁任择规则》第34条；联合国国际贸易法委员会《示范法》第34条":"Optional Rules for Arbitration of Disputes relating to Outer Space Activities, Article 34; UNCITRAL Model Law, Article 34",
