"空间资源":"Space resources",
"终局裁决":"Final award",
"美国 2015 年法案、卢森堡 2017 年法律；《月球协定》第11条":"US Act of 2015, Luxembourg law of 2017; Moon Agreement, Article 11",
"联合国《未来契约》附件《未来世代宣言》，2024":"UN Pact for the Future, Annex: Declaration on Future Generations, 2024",
"联合国国际贸易法委员会《国际商事仲裁示范法》第34条":"UNCITRAL Model Law on International Commercial Arbitration, Article 34",
"自己公开说过的话、做过的承诺，别人已经据此行事了，事后不能翻脸不认。":"What you have said openly or promised, once others have acted on it, cannot be denied later.",
"航天员落难时，各国有义务帮忙营救，并把人和航天器还给发射国。":"Where astronauts are in distress, States have a duty to help rescue them and to return both the people and the spacecraft to the launching State.",
"营救协定":"Rescue Agreement",
"要求发射国把送上天的东西登记在本国名册上，再报给联合国。登记了，大家才知道天上那个东西是谁的、该找谁。":"It requires the launching State to register what it sends up on its national registry, then report to the UN. Once registered, everyone knows whose the thing in the sky is and whom to ask.",
"证据要好到什么程度才算“证明了”。仲裁里通常要求“更可能是这样”（优势证据），不要求百分之百。":"How good the evidence must be to count as \"proved.\" Arbitration usually asks for \"more likely than not\" (preponderance), not one hundred percent.",
"证明标准":"Standard of proof",
"说了算的权力。在太空法里，主要指登记国对自己登记的物体（以及上面的人）有管理和控制的权力。":"The power to decide. In space law, chiefly the registered State's power to manage and control the object it has registered, and the people on it.",
"谁主张，谁举证。你说对方该赔，就要拿出证据；拿不出来，就承担不利后果。":"Whoever asserts must prove. If you say the other side should pay, produce the evidence; fail to, and you bear the adverse consequences.",
