"《月球协定》把月球及其自然资源称为“全人类的共同继承财产”。":"The Moon Agreement calls the Moon and its natural resources the \"common heritage of mankind.\"",
"一国的太空活动可能干扰别国时，应当事先进行国际磋商。":"Where one State's space activity may interfere with another, international consultation should come first.",
"东西一旦发射上天，就不再属于原来的主人了。":"Once something is launched, it no longer belongs to its original owner.",
"两颗卫星在轨道上相撞，受损的一方要证明对方有过错，才能拿到赔偿。":"Where two satellites collide in orbit, the damaged party must prove the other was at fault to recover.",
"几个国家合作发射一颗卫星，对它造成的损害负连带责任。":"Several States cooperating to launch a satellite bear joint and several liability for the damage it causes.",
"别国航天员在公海上溅落遇险，只有发射国有义务去救。":"Where foreign astronauts splash down in distress on the high seas, only the launching State has a duty to rescue.",
