"本委员会作出决定。红隼-9 是北方联盟发射的空间物体，它坠落在枫叶联邦境内，造成地面损害。依《责任公约》第二条，北方联盟承担绝对责任，赔偿申请人合理的清理费用。风暴有多强，不影响这个结论。":"The commission renders its decision. Kestrel-9 is a space object launched by the Northern Union; it fell within the territory of the applicant and caused damage on the ground. Under Article II of the Liability Convention, the Northern Union is absolutely liable and shall compensate the applicant's reasonable cleanup costs. How strong the storm was does not affect this conclusion.",
"本委员会现在开庭。枫叶联邦诉北方联盟，红隼-9 坠落造成地面损害。申请人请求赔偿清理费用约六百万元。双方都已同意，本委员会的决定有约束力。":"The commission now opens the hearing. Maple Federation v. Northern Union, damage on the ground caused by the fall of Kestrel-9. The applicant claims cleanup costs of about six million. Both sides have agreed that this commission's decision is binding.",
