"空间物体坠落造成地面损害的赔偿请求":"Claim for compensation for damage caused by a falling space object",
"第一卷。1978 年 1 月，北方联盟的核动力卫星“红隼-9”坠落在枫叶联邦北部的冻土上。两国谈了一年多没谈不拢，按[[责任公约]]成立了一个[[求偿委员会]]。":"Volume One. In January 1978, the Northern Union's nuclear-powered satellite \"Kestrel-9\" fell on the frozen north of the Maple Federation. The two States negotiated for over a year without resolution, and under the Liability Convention constituted a Claims Commission.",
"第九条不是索赔的依据。我们的请求权来自《责任公约》第二条。":"Article IX is not the basis for a claim. Our right to claim comes from Article II of the Liability Convention.",
"第九条讲的是各国要适当顾及别国、可能造成有害干扰要先协商。它说的污染，指的是把地外物质带回地球。拿它来要赔偿，找错了条文。":"Article IX is about due regard for other States and prior consultation where harmful interference may result. Its \"contamination\" means bringing extraterrestrial matter back to Earth. Using it to claim compensation cites the wrong provision.",
"红隼-9 就是在那场风暴里失去控制的。":"Kestrel-9 lost control in that very storm.",
"红隼-9 是北方联盟发射的空间物体，于 1978 年 1 月坠落于申请人北部地区，放射性残骸散落于长约六百公里的地带。依《责任公约》第二条，发射国对其空间物体在地球表面造成的损害承担绝对责任。第六条规定的免责情形，即损害由求偿国重大过失或故意造成，本案不存在。太阳风暴是否为失控原因，不影响责任的成立。":"Kestrel-9 is a space object launched by the Northern Union; it fell in January 1978 in the northern territory of the applicant, and radioactive debris scattered along a band some six hundred kilometres long. Under Article II of the Liability Convention, the launching State bears absolute liability for damage its space object causes on the surface of the Earth. The exonerating circumstance under Article VI, that the damage resulted from the claimant State's gross negligence or intent, does not exist here. Whether the solar storm caused the loss of control does not affect the existence of liability.",
"继续开庭。被申请人申请传唤证人：北方联盟北极气象站站长，贝拉。":"The hearing resumes. The respondent applies to call a witness: Bella, director of the Northern Union's Arctic weather station.",
