"《外空条约》第九条要求，可能造成有害干扰的活动要事先协商。北方联盟明知“老兵-3”挡在常用轨道上，却从没和任何国家协商过，也没有通报过任何人。单凭这一点，碰撞的过错就在对方。":"Article IX of the Outer Space Treaty requires prior consultation for activities that may cause harmful interference. The Northern Union knew \"Veteran-3\" sat in a heavily used orbit, yet never consulted any State and never notified anyone. On that alone, the fault for the collision lies with the other side.",
