"以损失代过错":"Loss in place of fault",
"仲裁庭退庭合议。陈岚问你：<br>“这一案赢了，可天上的卫星只会越来越多，预警每天成百上千。要是让你写一条轨道交通规则，你写什么？”":"The tribunal withdraws to deliberate. Chen Lan asks you:<br>\"You won this case, but the satellites overhead will only grow, and the warnings run to hundreds every day. If you could write one rule of space traffic, what would it be?\"",
"仲裁庭，两颗卫星在七百多公里高的地方相撞，没有目击者。低轨道越来越挤，碰撞早晚会发生。这是风险，不是过错。":"Tribunal, two satellites collided over seven hundred kilometres up, with no witnesses. Low orbit grows ever more crowded, and collisions will happen sooner or later. This is risk, not fault.",
