"我们还有一张牌：晨星内部有一份备忘录，标题是“先部署，后登记”，签名是麦格林本人。":"We hold one more card: inside Morning Star there is a memo headed \"deploy first, register after,\" signed by McGlin himself.",
"我叫塔玛，拾星合作社的。我们这些人的祖辈在海上认星星找路，现在我们在太空里捡别人掉下的东西。":"My name is Tama, of the Star-Picking Cooperative. Our ancestors read the stars to find their way at sea; now we pick up what others have dropped in space.",
"我没什么要补充的。":"I have nothing to add.",
"找不到主人":"No owner to be found",
"把主要的转运航道划成公共通道，谁都有义务保持畅通，挡路的东西由公共机构统一处理。":"Designate the main transfer lanes as public corridors; everyone has a duty to keep them clear, and things blocking them are handled by a public body.",
