"这封信应该由所有人一起写。用一整年，让每个国家、每种语言的人都有机会写一句。":"This letter should be written by everyone together. Take a full year, so that every country and every language has a chance to write a line.",
"这是她的心情，不是本案的事实。":"That is her feeling, not a fact of this case.",
