"这里是地球。我们有七千多种语言，这是其中几种。":"This is Earth. We have over seven thousand languages; these are a few of them.",
"院长　塔玛·卡哈努<br>仲裁员　奥卢·班科勒<br>青年席　{我}":"President Tama Kahanu<br>Arbitrator Olu Bankole<br>Junior bench {我}",
"青年席仲裁员":"Junior-bench arbitrator",
