"青年席，起草由你执笔。我和班科勒仲裁员会逐项审阅。":"Junior bench, the drafting is in your hand. Arbitrator Bankole and I will review it item by item.",
"第六章":"Chapter Six",
"1957 年 10 月，一颗金属球飞过了所有国家的上空。<br>它只会发出“嘀，嘀”的声音。":"October 1957. A metal ball passed over every country's sky.<br>All it could say was \"beep, beep.\"",
"2077 年，星海仲裁院。<br>这里存着人类在太空里吵过的每一架，也存着每一次是怎么吵完的。":"2077. The Stellar Arbitration Court.<br>Here are kept every quarrel humanity has had in space, and how each one was settled.",
"人们开始去月球上挖冰，去小行星上找矿。<br>地方不够分，就会起争执。":"People began mining ice on the Moon and hunting ore on asteroids.<br>When there is not enough ground to divide, quarrels start.",
"六十多年后，天上已经挤满了卫星。<br>好用的轨道只有那么几条，频率只有那么几段。":"Sixty years on, the sky is crowded with satellites.<br>There are only so many useful orbits, and only so many frequency bands.",
"太空里没有警察，也没有法院。<br>能用的，只有各国签下的条约，和一次次坐下来讲道理。":"There is no police in space, and no court.<br>All there is: the treaties States have signed, and the repeated sitting down to reason together.",
