"1969 · 鹰已着陆":"1969 · The eagle has landed",
"1969 年 7 月，阿波罗 11 号的登月舱“鹰”号降落在静海。着陆时燃料只剩下几十秒的余量。月面留下的铭牌写着：“我们为全人类的和平而来。”":"In July 1969, Apollo 11's lunar module \"Eagle\" came down in the Sea of Tranquillity, with only tens of seconds of fuel left. The plaque left on the surface reads: \"We came in peace for all mankind.\"",
"2019 年 1 月，嫦娥四号在月球背面的冯·卡门撞击坑着陆。月球背面看不到地球，通信要靠一颗停在远处的中继卫星转发。":"In January 2019, Chang'e-4 landed in the Von Kármán crater on the far side of the Moon. The far side never sees Earth, so communications rely on a relay satellite parked far off.",
"2023 年 8 月，月船 3 号在月球南极附近着陆。南极太阳总是贴着地平线，影子很长，地形看不清，这也是第五章那场官司发生的地方。":"In August 2023, Chandrayaan-3 landed near the lunar south pole. There the sun always hugs the horizon, shadows run long, and the terrain is hard to read. It is also where the dispute in Chapter Five takes place.",
