"下降太快了。":"Descending too fast.",
"再来一次":"Try again",
"按住“推力”减速，用左右键把着陆器摆正。<br>落在黄色平台上，下降速度小于 2 米/秒、机身基本竖直，就算成功。<br>键盘：方向键 ← → 转向，↑ 或空格推力。":"Hold \"Thrust\" to slow down and use left/right to level the lander.<br>Land on the yellow pad with descent under 2 m/s and the craft roughly upright to succeed.<br>Keyboard: ← → to turn, ↑ or Space for thrust.",
"月球的重力只有地球的六分之一，但没有空气，降落伞没用，只能靠发动机一点点减速。":"Lunar gravity is one sixth of Earth's, but with no air the parachute is useless; you slow down a little at a time on engine power alone.",
