"你画出的每一条曲线，都和真实的轨道遵守同一条物理定律。":"Every curve you draw obeys the same law of physics as a real orbit.",
"几千年来，世界各地的人看着同一片星空，编出了不一样的故事。":"For thousands of years, people the world over have looked at the same sky and told different stories.",
"北斗七星":"The Big Dipper",
"十字架一":"Crux I",
